{"id":"ee0e6fd2a5876cee","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zp-extension-tower.md","title":"Zp Extension Tower","display":"df-zp-extension-tower — Zp Extension Tower","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zp-extension-tower","aliases":["58-df-zp-extension-tower","Zp Extension Tower"],"display":"df-zp-extension-tower — Zp Extension Tower","depends_on":["[[58-df-prime-number]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-field-extension]]","[[58-df-galois-group]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zp-extension-tower"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zp-extension-tower</span><span>Zp Extension Tower</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zp-extension-tower — Zp Extension Tower"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dad686059f3ca152\" href=\"?note=dad686059f3ca152\" title=\"58-df-prime-number\">58-df-prime-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"699918fd54cc2a8e\" href=\"?note=699918fd54cc2a8e\" title=\"58-df-field-extension\">58-df-field-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dac0596ff0a0af4a\" href=\"?note=dac0596ff0a0af4a\" title=\"58-df-galois-group\">58-df-galois-group</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_\\infty,K,p,\\vec K,\\vec\\sigma,m,n,g\\in V\">\\(K_\\infty,K,p,\\vec K,\\vec\\sigma,m,n,g\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prime}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prime}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Gal}_{\\sigma}(L/K)\">\\(\\operatorname{Gal}_{\\sigma}(L/K)\\)</span> is the Galois-group construction from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dac0596ff0a0af4a\" href=\"?note=dac0596ff0a0af4a\" title=\"58-df-galois-group\">58-df-galois-group</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZpExtensionTower}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZpExtensionTower}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zp\\text{-}extension\\text{-}tower}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZpExtensionTower}_S(K_\\infty,K,p,\\vec K)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec K,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec K))\n\\land\\vec K(0)=K\n\\land K_\\infty=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec K(n)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists\\vec\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\sigma,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\sigma))\n\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(m\\leq n\\to\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(\\vec K(n),\\vec K(m))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n[\\vec K(n):K]=p^n\n\\land\\exists g\\in\\operatorname{Gal}_{\\vec\\sigma(n)}(\\vec K(n)/K)\\;\n\\operatorname{Gal}_{\\vec\\sigma(n)}(\\vec K(n)/K)=\\{g^i\\mid i\\in p^n\\}\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zp\\text{-}extension\\text{-}tower}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZpExtensionTower}_S(K_\\infty,K,p,\\vec K)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec K,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec K))\n\\land\\vec K(0)=K\n\\land K_\\infty=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec K(n)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists\\vec\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\sigma,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\sigma))\n\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(m\\leq n\\to\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(\\vec K(n),\\vec K(m))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n[\\vec K(n):K]=p^n\n\\land\\exists g\\in\\operatorname{Gal}_{\\vec\\sigma(n)}(\\vec K(n)/K)\\;\n\\operatorname{Gal}_{\\vec\\sigma(n)}(\\vec K(n)/K)=\\{g^i\\mid i\\in p^n\\}\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The chosen nested tower has cyclic Galois group of order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^n\">\\(p^n\\)</span> at level <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, and its union is the displayed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z_p\">\\(\\mathbb Z_p\\)</span>-extension.</li>\n<li>Carrying the tower explicitly is essential for levelwise class-number statements such as Iwasawa's growth theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-prime-number","status":"resolved","id":"dad686059f3ca152","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-prime-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field-extension","status":"resolved","id":"699918fd54cc2a8e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-galois-group","status":"resolved","id":"dac0596ff0a0af4a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-galois-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-galois-group","status":"resolved","id":"dac0596ff0a0af4a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Gal}_{\\sigma}(L/K)$ is the Galois-group construction from [[58-df-galois-group]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K_\\infty,K,p,\\vec K,\\vec\\sigma,m,n,g\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prime}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Gal}_{\\sigma}(L/K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZpExtensionTower}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zp\\text{-}extension\\text{-}tower}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZpExtensionTower}_S(K_\\infty,K,p,\\vec K)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec K,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec K))\n\\land\\vec K(0)=K\n\\land K_\\infty=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec K(n)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\exists\\vec\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\sigma,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\sigma))\n\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(m\\leq n\\to\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(\\vec K(n),\\vec K(m))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n[\\vec K(n):K]=p^n\n\\land\\exists g\\in\\operatorname{Gal}_{\\vec\\sigma(n)}(\\vec K(n)/K)\\;\n\\operatorname{Gal}_{\\vec\\sigma(n)}(\\vec K(n)/K)=\\{g^i\\mid i\\in p^n\\}\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"p^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z_p","display":false}],"bytes":1745,"backlinks":[{"id":"7ceaa450caff8261","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-376","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-zp-extension-tower]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3873","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zp-extension-tower.md|58-df-zp-extension-tower]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["dad686059f3ca152","36d7463d215be751","699918fd54cc2a8e","dac0596ff0a0af4a"]}